2A. In respect of the fees specified in the following Parts of the First Schedule, an amount equivalent to 9% of each fee (exclusive of GST) is waived for the period between 1 October 2024 and 31 December 2025 (both dates inclusive):
(a)items 11(b) and 12(a)(ii), (b)(ii) and (c)(ii) of Part II;
(b)items 1, 2, 12, 13 and 15 of Part III;
(c)items 4 and 5(b) of Part IV.
[S 760/2024 wef 01/10/2024]

3.—(1) In these Regulations —
“chemical tanker”, “liquefied gas tanker” and “oil tanker” have the meanings given to them in regulation 2 of the Merchant Shipping (Training, Certification and Manning) Regulations (Rg 1);
“tanker” means a chemical tanker, liquefied gas tanker or oil tanker;
“tons” and “tonnage” refer to gross tonnage.
[S 300/2017 wef 01/07/2017]
(2) Nothing in these Regulations shall apply to any service provided before 1st April 1995, and in respect of any such service, the fee payable shall be that applicable at the time of the provision of the service.
